<title>NIGERIA: Nigeria's NAL Bank year profit.</title>
<headline>Nigeria's NAL Bank year profit.</headline>
<text>
<p>LAGOS, July 31 (Reuter) Full year results for Nigeria's NAL Merchant Bank Plc to end-March 1997.</p>
<p>			     (In million naira)</p>
<p>			     1997	 1996</p>
<p> Gross earnings	  1,400	1,200</p>
<p> Profit before taxation  433	  250</p>
<p> Profit after taxation   390	  203</p>
<p>NOTE - The Nigerian Stock Exchange said information on the proposed dividend would be supplied later.</p>
<p>($1=83 naira)</p>
<p>-- Lagos newsroom +234 1 263 03 17</p>
</text>
